      "note": "Rise and shine for the terraces; the sun won’t wait.",
      "note": "The must-do stays, and it is already easy on the wallet."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p6",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "A free palace stop keeps the day gentle and kind to the budget."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p16",
      "kind": "meal",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "A lighter vegan lunch in Ubud, terima kasih (thank you) to a place everyone can eat."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p7",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "The ridge walk is free, open all day, and gives the crew room to breathe."
    }
  ]
